######## Test check (LOCAL ONLY, stop-factor.test-check.enabled=true) ########
# Runs StopFactorService.check with imitated KIB / OB data and saves the results like a real scoring.
# Scorings 1..8 (changelog 1.2, scoring id = product id): 1 Online кредит, 2 Тумар, 4 Тунук онлайн, 6 Онлайн ИФЦ,
# 7 BakAi сплит, 8 Кредитная карта (RETAIL), 3 Онлайн кредит для ИП, 5 Бизнес лимит (MSB)

### Ready scenarios with their expected decisions
GET http://localhost:9090/api/v1/admin/test/stop-factor-check/scenarios

### Run a scenario (asExpected shows whether the decision matches)
POST http://localhost:9090/api/v1/admin/test/stop-factor-check/scenarios/msb-same-history-yellow

### Overdue history: 6 overdue months of 5 days in months 1..3 -> Retail REJECTED (try scoringId 5 = Бизнес лимит -> UNDERWRITER)
POST http://localhost:9090/api/v1/admin/test/stop-factor-check
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scoringId": 1,
  "kib": {
    "loans": [ { "role": "MainDebtor", "status": "Open" } ],
    "overdueMonths": [
      { "monthsAgo": 1, "maxOverdueDays": 5 }, { "monthsAgo": 2, "maxOverdueDays": 5 }, { "monthsAgo": 2, "maxOverdueDays": 3 },
      { "monthsAgo": 3, "maxOverdueDays": 7 }, { "monthsAgo": 3, "maxOverdueDays": 10 }, { "monthsAgo": 3, "maxOverdueDays": 1 }
    ]
  }
}

### Raw KIB payment calendars -> KibOverdueHistoryReader finds the months with overdue (as the KIB module)
# One entry per month, as KIB sends it: maxPastDueDays - largest overdue in the month, pastDueDays - left at its end.
# MainDebtor: 4 days in September, 12 in October -> 2 months (OK); 25 days in June -> months 4..6, 21+ days -> REJECTED.
# Guarantor and CoDebtor contracts are not counted.
POST http://localhost:9090/api/v1/admin/test/stop-factor-check
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scoringId": -300,
  "productId": 1,
  "requestDate": "2026-11-04",
  "kib": {
    "contracts": [
      { "role": "MainDebtor", "calendar": [
          { "date": "2026-09-30", "maxPastDueDays": 4, "pastDueDays": 4 },
          { "date": "2026-10-31", "maxPastDueDays": 12, "pastDueDays": 0 } ] },
      { "role": "MainDebtor", "calendar": [ { "date": "2026-06-30", "maxPastDueDays": 25, "pastDueDays": 0 } ] },
      { "role": "Guarantor", "calendar": [ { "date": "2026-10-31", "maxPastDueDays": 90, "pastDueDays": 0 } ] },
      { "role": "CoDebtor", "calendar": [ { "date": "2026-10-31", "maxPastDueDays": 40, "pastDueDays": 0 } ] }
    ]
  }
}


### Products: 2 months of 15 days overdue in months 7..12 -> Online кредит REJECTED (try scoringId 5 = Бизнес лимит -> APPROVED)
POST http://localhost:9090/api/v1/admin/test/stop-factor-check
Content-Type: application/json

{ "scoringId": 1, "kib": { "overdueMonths": [ { "monthsAgo": 8, "maxOverdueDays": 15 }, { "monthsAgo": 10, "maxOverdueDays": 15 } ] } }

### Any scoring linked to a product: productId writes public.scoring
POST http://localhost:9090/api/v1/admin/test/stop-factor-check
Content-Type: application/json

{ "scoringId": -100, "productId": 5, "kib": { "newCreditsLast30Days": 4 } }

### Missing data: no KIB report, only OB (current overdue 5 days -> REJECTED 451)
POST http://localhost:9090/api/v1/admin/test/stop-factor-check
Content-Type: application/json

{ "scoringId": 2, "obCredits": [ { "overdueDays": 5, "overdueSum": 1200.50, "lastChangeDate": "2026-10-01" } ] }

### Missing data: partial KIB report (no consolidation) -> the disputes are not checked
POST http://localhost:9090/api/v1/admin/test/stop-factor-check
Content-Type: application/json

{ "scoringId": 1, "kib": { "activeDisputes": 2, "missingParts": ["CONSOLIDATION"] } }

### Missing data: SPR could not build the overdue overdue months -> new ranges NO_DATA -> UNDERWRITER
POST http://localhost:9090/api/v1/admin/test/stop-factor-check
Content-Type: application/json

{ "scoringId": 1, "kib": { "calendarsUnavailable": true } }

### Missing data: scoring without product -> RETAIL, product limits ignored
POST http://localhost:9090/api/v1/admin/test/stop-factor-check
Content-Type: application/json

{ "kib": {} }

### Saved results of a scoring
GET http://localhost:9090/api/v1/stop-factors/checks/1

######## Admin API ########

### Products (read only, managed by SPR)
GET http://localhost:9090/api/v1/admin/products

### One product with its segment
GET http://localhost:9090/api/v1/admin/products/5

### Metrics (current versions)
GET http://localhost:9090/api/v1/admin/metrics

### Metrics as they were at a moment, and the versions of one metric
GET http://localhost:9090/api/v1/admin/metrics?at=2026-11-01T00:00:00

###
GET http://localhost:9090/api/v1/admin/metrics/10/versions

### Calculators: what a metric can measure, its params, condition value types and operators
GET http://localhost:9090/api/v1/admin/metrics/calculators

### Create a metric (params default to the calculator's params; a later title/template/params change needs changeReason)
POST http://localhost:9090/api/v1/admin/metrics
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Запросы в КИБ за период", "calculator": "BUREAU_REQUESTS_COUNT", "nameTemplate": "Запросы в кредитное бюро за {days} дней" }

######## Stop factor groups ########
# A group is the versioned unit: every change creates a new version with all its stop factors.

### Current groups (filters: active, metricId, productId, segment)
GET http://localhost:9090/api/v1/admin/stop-factor-groups?active=true

### Groups that check applications of a product
GET http://localhost:9090/api/v1/admin/stop-factor-groups?productId=5

### Groups as they were at a moment, each stop factor with the metric version it used then
GET http://localhost:9090/api/v1/admin/stop-factor-groups?at=2026-11-01T00:00:00

### The overdue history group / its versions
GET http://localhost:9090/api/v1/admin/stop-factor-groups/13

###
GET http://localhost:9090/api/v1/admin/stop-factor-groups/13/versions

### Create a group: every stop factor with its own metric, params, conditions, segment and products
POST http://localhost:9090/api/v1/admin/stop-factor-groups
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Кредитный комитет",
  "factors": [
    {
      "metricId": 10,
      "params": { "periodFromMonth": 1, "periodToMonth": 6, "minOverdueDays": 30, "maxOverdueDays": 60 },
      "segment": "RETAIL",
      "productIds": [1, 2],
      "conditions": [ { "result": "REJECTED", "valueType": "INTEGER", "value": "0" } ]
    },
    {
      "metricId": 2,
      "params": {},
      "segment": "MSB",
      "conditions": [ { "result": "UNDERWRITER", "valueType": "INTEGER", "value": "0", "operator": "RANGE", "valueTo": "2" },
                      { "result": "REJECTED", "valueType": "INTEGER", "value": "2" } ]
    }
  ]
}

### Deactivate / activate a group
PATCH http://localhost:9090/api/v1/admin/stop-factor-groups/9/status?active=false&changeReason=Временно отключен

### Display order: every current group id in the new order
PUT http://localhost:9090/api/v1/admin/stop-factor-groups/order
Content-Type: application/json

[1, 2, 3, 4, 8, 9, 10, 11, 12, 13]

### Delete a group (its versions stay in the history)
DELETE http://localhost:9090/api/v1/admin/stop-factor-groups/9?changeReason=Больше не используется

######## Stop factors of a group ########
# Every change is a new group version: stop factor ids change, take them from the response.

### Stop factors of the restructurings group
GET http://localhost:9090/api/v1/admin/stop-factor-groups/4/stop-factors

### One stop factor
GET http://localhost:9090/api/v1/admin/stop-factor-groups/4/stop-factors/4

### Add a stop factor (name left out: rendered from the params)
POST http://localhost:9090/api/v1/admin/stop-factor-groups/4/stop-factors?changeReason=Период 25-36 месяцев
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "metricId": 4,
  "params": { "source": "KIB", "periodFromMonth": 25, "periodToMonth": 36 },
  "conditions": [ { "result": "REJECTED", "valueType": "INTEGER", "value": "1" } ]
}

### Replace a stop factor (name, params, conditions, active, segment, products)
PUT http://localhost:9090/api/v1/admin/stop-factor-groups/4/stop-factors/4?changeReason=Только для Розницы
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "metricId": 4,
  "params": { "source": "KIB", "periodFromMonth": 1, "periodToMonth": 12 },
  "segment": "RETAIL",
  "conditions": [ { "result": "REJECTED", "valueType": "INTEGER", "value": "0" } ]
}

### Remove a stop factor (not the only one of the group)
DELETE http://localhost:9090/api/v1/admin/stop-factor-groups/4/stop-factors/5?changeReason=Не нужен

######## Conditions of a stop factor ########

### Conditions
GET http://localhost:9090/api/v1/admin/stop-factor-groups/4/stop-factors/4/conditions

### Set the UNDERWRITER condition (replaces the existing one of that result)
PUT http://localhost:9090/api/v1/admin/stop-factor-groups/4/stop-factors/4/conditions?changeReason=Жёлтая зона
Content-Type: application/json

{ "result": "UNDERWRITER", "valueType": "INTEGER", "value": "0", "operator": "GT" }

### Remove the UNDERWRITER condition
DELETE http://localhost:9090/api/v1/admin/stop-factor-groups/4/stop-factors/4/conditions/UNDERWRITER?changeReason=Без жёлтой зоны
